{"id":"wb-8-446","name":"云南提督府旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"云南提督府旧址","text":"云南提督府旧址，又称杜文秀元帅府，位于今中国云南省大理白族自治州大理市大理镇大理古城内，复兴路南段111号，1856年杜文秀领导的农民起义军攻占大理府城后，设元帅府于此。现为大理市博物馆所在地。属于第八批全国重点文物保护单位，大理州革命遗址。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%91%E5%8D%97%E6%8F%90%E7%9D%A3%E5%BA%9C%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":90977011,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90977011","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/acfec02e66e421e33d8e54b1.jpg","title":"Dali_Old_Town_30.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dali_Old_Town_30.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a3/Dali_Old_Town_30.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Brücke-Osteuropa","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​大理杜文秀元帅府","width":320,"height":180}}